        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c76dcf3a-f9fa-4173-8129-1d0cb9fcfe6a\",\"review_text\":\"First time I saw this type of app really awesome 👌👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"4e4c0ec8-e42b-4428-b192-d527c3384aab\",\"review_text\":\"Nice but i am not install\"},{\"review_id\":\"7a7e7a59-4d62-46de-b524-7e83e0831caa\",\"review_text\":\"Love this app there's so much music to listen to and I use my playlists all the time! 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c0a838b-2af2-4893-b8a2-315c41932dc3\",\"review_text\":\"Very very Good\"},{\"review_id\":\"7e506051-c39b-475f-bf7a-d1644de5faa0\",\"review_text\":\"I love listening to podcasts and music on my phone as I travel about using Spotify.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9ae23d2-1152-4bfe-a876-afc09c005377\",\"review_text\":\"The ads are really annoying and sometimes I get five one after the other and I hate it when I'm playing my liked songs and random songs that really don't match anything I listen to appear even when I haven't liked them\"},{\"review_id\":\"68edb14c-aa3c-4d89-918b-d26550902f5d\",\"review_text\":\"Superb!\"},{\"review_id\":\"df239418-e786-4b6f-9545-6946e1960b89\",\"review_text\":\"Greatly satisfied with the selection of tracks on the playlist much appreciated for my listening pleasure.\"},{\"review_id\":\"57aca404-d58b-4bb4-97b1-c64db92f054a\",\"review_text\":\"I cant't buy premium correctly. it show that my internet is poor.\"},{\"review_id\":\"70b76b68-4876-42a9-b1fe-80087693908b\",\"review_text\":\"Same on you sportify team. There is 5 advertisement of 30 sec each. Ahhh thooo\"}]}"
